Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|solr.enabled|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|SOLR Impl|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Solr Page|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Search Assets Scope Everything Across Multiple Sites
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name 1|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|Apple|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name 2|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Apple|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name 3|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Apple|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Search|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And Search configure Search Scope PG
		|searchScope|Everything|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Search search PG
		|searchTerm|Apple|
	And Search view Search Results PG
		|searchAssetTitle|Apple|
		|searchAssetType|Web Content Article|
	And Search view Search Results PG
		|searchAssetTitle|Apple|
		|searchAssetType|Document|
	Then Search view Search Results PG
		|searchAssetTitle|Apple|
		|searchAssetType|Blogs Entry|
Scenario: Solr Smoke Test
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SolrEE#SolrSmokeTest|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread add CP
		|threadBody|Orange|
		|threadSubject|Apple|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|Orange|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Apple|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration execute Server Resources Actions
		|actionsDescription|Reindex all search indexes.|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Solr Page|
	And Search search PG
		|searchTerm|Apple|
	And Search view Search Results PG
		|searchAssetTitle|Apple|
		|searchAssetType|Document|
	And Search view Search Results PG
		|searchAssetTitle|Apple|
		|searchAssetType|Message Boards Message|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Solr Page|
	And Search search PG
		|searchTerm|Orange|
	And Search view Search Results PG
		|searchAssetTitle|Apple|
		|searchAssetType|Document|
	Then Search view Search Results PG
		|searchAssetTitle|Apple|
		|searchAssetType|Message Boards Message|
