		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SolrEE#SolrWithSolrCloudSmokeTest|
	And Solr view Solrwith Solr Cloud Enabled In Console
	And Solr view Liferay Cloud Dashboard
		|cloudCollectionName|liferay|
