Scenario: View Reindex All Search Indexes Logging In Solr Admin
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|index.on.startup|false|
	When these properties
		|solr.logging.info.level|true|
	And these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SolrEE#ViewReindexAllSearchIndexesLoggingInSolrAdmin|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration execute Server Resources Actions
		|actionsDescription|Reindex all search indexes.|
	And Navigator open Specific URL
		|url|http://localhost:8983/solr/#/~logging|
	Then Solr view Logger Name In Solr Admin Logging